Small one-line fix plus a regression test — reviewers who have touched this code most recently, could you take a look when you have a moment?

@hxbai — you fixed the neighbouring failure in the same `optimizer_cpu_offload` + `mark_keep_in_fp32` combination in #6124; this is the `DistributedOptimizer` shard-view half that your test (which drives `HybridDeviceOptimizer` with raw leaf params) does not reach.
